# stills-tools — what `/tools` lists, standing still.
#
# Recorded `--raw` and cut with `scripts/cast-still.py` at the driver log's times, like `stills`.
#
#   S=web/src/assets/captures
#   scripts/cast-still.py $S/stills-tools.cast --at <still: tools + 0.5> --crop 41,19,109,13 --out $S/tools.svg
#
# No turn: an earlier take ran a rename to show the tools at work, and the model did it with `sed`,
# which is a fine answer and the wrong picture for a section about what the toolset adds.

#: cols 150
#: rows 36
#: model anthropic/claude-sonnet-5-5
#: thinking low
#: glyphs nerd

sleep 3
mark start

log tools
enter /tools
sleep 3
log still: tools
sleep 1
key Escape
sleep 1
mark end
